The HP 6220 I have issues a bus check notification when the internal CD
drive is inserted or removed. Do we currently do anything with that?
Presumably userspace ought to be notified (in order to allow tidying up
of any applications using the device), and the kernel ought to know in
order to unregister the device. A quick play suggests that this isn't
currently happening.
